  ('CSC 222', 'Principles of Crop Production', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Agriculture', 'Crop Science', '200 Level', 'second', 2, 'Fundamental principles and problems of crop production. The importance of crop rotation, cultural practices, water and soil conservation, irrigation and drainage. Maintenance of soil fertility. Pests, diseases and weed control in crop production. Principles and methods of crop harvesting; crop processing and storage. Specific cultural requirements and practices in the production of field, forage and plantation crops.', '[]'::jsonb, 'UNN Department of Crop Science official website', false),
